#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:29 1fa9df87667e422b850414105ab85c33
#: 2d1e672132054054b85463f1e12652f2 b846bf8edfe948ee9f848a1629980024
#: cc3ab5261b594ad6add97ada4346ed19 d67eda1c264448fe897c50c1c5616370
#: fcaaa6e07b9541149f4c92a67dd8b83a
msgid ""
"MAVLink connected RC (not to be confused with MAVLink RC Overrides used for "
"CS joystick control of RC functions)"
msgstr "MAVLink 连接的 RC（不要与用于地面站摇杆控制 RC 功能的 MAVLink RC 覆盖混淆）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:30 08039bd32fbf45b7bd6089c112098f44
#: 46aaea44d7e14cc79aea2544aa6c17ee 6df995883b864f5cb71dbc1978383322
#: 725bf429b0f14dbf9c4c93eead973266 78166b5799c44d289be8b9b716f949a3
#: fb0f7e9c7c7f4f69a9aec5118949c9bf
msgid ""
"Parallel PWM outputs encoded to PPM-Sum using an external encoder (see "
"below, not supported on many autopilots now)"
msgstr "通过外部编码器将并行 PWM 输出编码为 PPM-Sum（见下文，许多飞控现已不支持）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:33 1c2117ab1e474adeacb3c5315464f0e6
#: 5f55d02dcb82453f9b188038c70627ec 7208e1e997cd472294c38a92c6ad7da9
#: c2a8f401b5b741c696185191a2ebc09f c7595fd2be4c40419181f963438475ca
#: ee22cca7d1ce4e4a90501a3538ad7fdc
msgid "Connecting the Receiver"
msgstr "连接接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:35 3e9a010602c04b9a909b7a19a67defad
#: 5d46d38d14404fe7ba6688e54426c7fd 80593ab4eb494006a055e4ef6294d412
#: c63b49790a9e4fc88cff0505005556df f15b23988b3e4a0e82ef19717e6a1f19
#: f57eb82de8c8414790b801dc3690cea0
msgid ""
"For all protocols above, ArduPilot auto-detects the protocol of the RC "
"receiver system. However, depending on the protocol and autopilot type, the "
"physical connection to the autopilot may differ."
msgstr ""
"对于上述所有协议，ArduPilot 均可自动检测 RC 接收机系统所使用的协议。但根据协议和飞控类型的不同，与飞控的物理连接方式可能有所不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:37 280023475f10485fbdfbef637a88a17f
#: 7a700bc6fabc47b1845487fc0ae85407 a4e947f622c74ca280a694e94d7e644f
#: c1b16ce634304130852d5264aa553f82 c6ba7545393a4cb3add8b4985e7f9fbb
#: de5fedc6a9b146e7a6aa203ca20f5e30
msgid ""
"Some protocols, most notably SRXL2, CRSF, and ELRS, require a full UART "
"connection."
msgstr "部分协议（尤其是 SRXL2、CRSF 和 ELRS）需要完整的 UART 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:39 256af121180d4a669139ad2979839795
#: 4a6bebb69ea24ceba56fedf549fec593 a66ed3632eec44b3a4add4b26fa84dd6
#: d03538448ae347be9bd573c6aac63571 d29871d5948e4c6fa628cd724fc93df0
#: ea0e3badfa6a4c17a3ae6bfc6e31be94
msgid ""
"In addition other protocols that also provide telemetry, like FPort, would "
"generally require a bi-directional half-duplex connection in order to obtain"
" telemetry. For these protocols the TX output of the UART should be "
"connected to the serial input of the receiver. It is also possible on F7 and"
" H7 boards to connect to the UART RX input with some additional "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"此外，FPort 等同时提供数传功能的协议通常需要双向半双工连接才能获取数传数据。对于这些协议，UART 的 TX 输出应连接至接收机的串口输入。在 "
"F7 和 H7 板上，也可通过额外配置连接至 UART 的 RX 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:42 18672e4a31434b5a91efff6b822ba1b5
#: 1aaaf97f699f47fc9278e5ad33258561 c2a958ec0673407f921c090c76d4ba33
#: c6d6da6f25334b4e9676a9d80b2972a1 d855efea9b244d70b072bfaf74d88089
#: ec709abe060f4ab3a249373d2097083c
msgid "PPM-Sum/SBus/i-BUS"
msgstr "PPM-Sum / SBus / i-BUS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:44 16fe7d2dc2ed445e9c5af2a8631ff042
#: 171468e4bd0842cba6cc93f0593fe677 26a90c09fe224760a3812d575896ca0e
#: 5de59a5fd6b84396b4b3d9c82164fabf c451ff58fe864646bd1fcea5bb18ad8f
#: ee7976e7ea88481fbabf8962dee018fc
msgid ""
"These receivers are usually connected to the RCin or SBUS input pin on the "
"autopilot."
msgstr "这些接收机通常连接至飞控的 RCin 或 SBUS 输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:46 143bbdd0113c4882bbc83d9191bc7576
#: 7aea7ec3682e4792acfbb2819dc883d2 8e2c88182d464f5b8f5e159ec5d6ef9a
#: 98ab1924db4a429d9ad7097086c3d055 be1532b3d7ca4f5484d4c6b5d4f8ee66
#: da68d89868f340618ed818b74ebfed90
msgid ""
"To connect a PPM-Sum receiver or an SBus receiver to a Pixhawk, for example,"
" plug the ground (black), power (red) and signal (usually white - orange in "
"the diagram below) wires to the RC pins on the Pixhawk."
msgstr ""
"例如，将 PPM-Sum 或 SBus 接收机连接至 Pixhawk 时，将地线（黑）、电源线（红）和信号线（通常为白色，下图中为橙色）插入 "
"Pixhawk 的 RC 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:53 38550460518e41e3ac60ba6eff8b6816
#: 52563a39724c477c8940e425a7006942 731c7fcd87a24c8182c1cdff27b6935f
#: 87fa5fe1b94341f288bba63a127f66df ef83e7851cfe4e2886cd485c332955a3
#: f45790d2cb404c2095d706b04d57c57b
msgid ""
"The parameter to enable the SBus output from the PixHawk style autopilots is"
" :ref:`BRD_SBUS_OUT<BRD_SBUS_OUT>`. This is only to pass SBus externally to "
"other devices, like servos. Not to connect a receiver to RCin or SBus In."
msgstr ""
"在 PixHawk 风格飞控上启用 SBus 输出的参数为 :ref:`BRD_SBUS_OUT<BRD_SBUS_OUT>`。此功能仅用于将 SBus"
" 信号输出至外部设备（如舵机），而非将接收机连接至 RCin 或 SBus 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:58 04a84997990942a0a6de74ac4525c667
#: 077352c5501e447b84ff26c89b375d18 642dcb833f594bbfbf467bfbc9d4aae2
#: 7006622d234c4a13b7520b20b7cea904 74aae266f29846a48705862b333f6023
#: ab4db3adeec04e9480bed486f3c452ea
msgid "DSM/DSM2/DSM-X/SRXL/SUM-D"
msgstr "DSM / DSM2 / DSM-X / SRXL / SUM-D"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:60 0ea960de5aa042758c60a054656a4d35
#: 19e985649f054d0abb68ff24d4534c72 4c2ea022956c4ec1aa9b51622f4615ac
#: 64422a7f48714408afaa5ec6c3171eff d770a77e42f341628b99a77cccb24c5b
#: ea78715531bf4226a9205957102e4cfa
msgid ""
"For autopilots that do not provide a separate ``DSM`` input, these can be "
"connected as above. However, for performance reasons on autopilots that use "
"an IOMCU (The Pixhawk/Cube family), the autopilot's ``DSM`` input connection"
" is highly recommended."
msgstr ""
"对于没有独立 ``DSM`` 输入的飞控，这些协议的接收机可按上述方式连接。但对于使用 IOMCU 的飞控（Pixhawk/Cube "
"系列），出于性能考虑，强烈建议使用飞控的专用 ``DSM`` 输入接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:66 08d81bff0c7f4dfb987f61130058109e
#: 2256f44c55974eb8b7c97e8ced673c92 96bcfebf700547d392485e342516eda8
#: 96c207dda64a4a9ca14e4ca47136cd2f 9f42daf6c9784643a4273f7fe4a2dc78
#: e1491be5c50c4f0ebd62e4302e6c6a11
msgid "FPort/FPort2"
msgstr "FPort / FPort2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:68 1c3af0a6f77e46b1abdcff9a7bc7d14e
#: 2e62c64a78624b0bb166e6f73047a866 82f591fa503b4e6a80ba0fc45f308b21
#: 8b2b8a6652804023800e23b08890990a a457ff7da1944b5a969924e002240378
#: fe0f02a933f5482aa2b5c33cbc84b51f
msgid ""
"FPort is a bi-directional protocol, using SBus RC in one direction, and "
"serial telemetry in the other. The RC portion can be decoded when attached "
"to an autopilot as if it were SBus, but the embedded telemetry would be "
"lost. See the :ref:`FPort setup documentation<common-FPort-receivers>` for "
"details on connection to one of the autopilots Serial Ports."
msgstr ""
"FPort 是双向协议，一个方向传输 SBus RC 信号，另一个方向传输串口数传。将其连接至飞控时，RC 部分可像 SBus "
"一样解码，但嵌入的数传数据将丢失。有关连接至飞控串口的详情，请参阅 :ref:`FPort 设置文档<common-FPort-receivers>`。"

