"ArduPilot requires at least 5 channels for most vehicles, however, 8 to 16 "
"channels are commonly available in most systems and are very convenient for "
"controlling other vehicle functions such as cameras or flight feature "
"options. Many vehicles require 8 channels just for basic operation, such as "
"many QuadPlanes."
