#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:171
#: 846a2cc45cb6426fad154729c7af3348 8d67ab1dc7d94041a0aa8fc131fb659d
#: 99ac9006284444ed94c10d6b13fada73 9a7024e50e274e1685dfe802adf217c3
#: d937be2986954b4cbf239368761aa11d f02572b2a6fc4f8b8916b7392ced2922
msgid ""
"Note 1: DragonLink provides a 56Kbaud transparent link for telemetry, "
"allowing full MAVLink telemetry to/from the vehicle from the transmitter "
"module. Dragonlink is an add-on module to the transmitter, such as an FRSky "
"Taranis or RadioMaster T16. See :ref:`common-dragonlink-rc`. `MTP (Mavlink "
"to Passthru) converters "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?3089648-Mavlink-To-FrSky-"
"Passthrough-Converter>`__ are available to allow direct display of MAVLink "
"Telemetry data on OpenTX transmitters using :ref:`Yaapu Telemetry LUA "
"Script<common-frsky-yaapu>`."
msgstr ""
"备注 1：DragonLink 提供 56Kbaud 透明数传链路，可从发射机模块实现与飞行器的完整 MAVLink 双向数传。Dragonlink 是"
" FRSky Taranis 或 RadioMaster T16 等发射机的附加模块。参见 :ref:`common-dragonlink-"
"rc`。`MTP（Mavlink 转 Passthru）转换器 "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?3089648-Mavlink-To-FrSky-"
"Passthrough-Converter>`__ 可配合 :ref:`Yaapu Telemetry LUA 脚本<common-frsky-"
"yaapu>` 在 OpenTX 发射机上直接显示 MAVLink 数传数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:173
#: 0397d569c7244e73b280a163480854b7 5e0558a07a4a428d9f9aad8f3d2fb0c8
#: 6b5bb889eb614a708339e13eec942572 881119e81ed944b4addd73bed56016ae
#: cdd961df23864d7a96cce003bb99e40a fc618bcff98e43ec86950f55ceccf185
msgid ""
"Note 2: See :ref:`common-frsky-yaapu`. The ability to change parameters over"
" FRSky telemetry from an Open TX compatible transmitter in addition to "
"displaying the telemetry data is possible. Most FRSky compatible "
"transmitters use `OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__. Note that R9 systems"
" are not quite Long Range, but much further range than normal FRSky systems,"
" themselves at the very high end of the Short Range category at 1.6-2km "
"range."
msgstr ""
"备注 2：参见 :ref:`common-frsky-yaapu`。除显示数传数据外，还可通过 Open TX 兼容发射机经由 FRSky "
"数传修改参数。大多数 FRSky 兼容发射机使用 `OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__。请注意，R9 "
"系统并非严格意义上的长距系统，但远超普通 FRSky 系统的距离，普通 FRSky 系统属于短距类别的最高端，约 1.6–2km 距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:175
#: 4c48c09d45f846adb18584bd47377fd0 6c84c0a597ac44e1bb14dec540087fac
#: 99b5f519879442deb606d066f54ffb66 ba92122d80854b54a64cae5f49196b51
#: d69070bf7c8243c6959a620a909fa97b e73126b003344886934b18e5b346b888
msgid ""
"Note 3: ArduPilot provides a means to send its telemetry data via CRSF such "
"that it can be displayed on `OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ "
"transmitters using the :ref:`Yaapu Telemetry LUA Script<common-frsky-"
"yaapu>`. The ability to change parameters over CRSF telemetry from an Open "
"TX compatible transmitter in addition to displaying the telemetry data is "
"also possible. See :ref:`common-crsf-telemetry`"
msgstr ""
"备注 3：ArduPilot 提供通过 CRSF 发送数传数据的方式，使其可在使用 :ref:`Yaapu Telemetry LUA "
"脚本<common-frsky-yaapu>` 的 `OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ "
"发射机上显示。除显示数传数据外，还可通过 Open TX 兼容发射机经由 CRSF 数传修改参数。参见 :ref:`common-crsf-"
"telemetry`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:177
#: 021c4297ddcc4a0cb7f99b695b9ea1ce
msgid ""
"Note 4: ELRS (ExpressLRS) is a flexible open-source system that can output "
"CRSF, SBUS, or MAVLink (with embedded RC) protocols. Telemetry requires the "
"use of CRSF or Mavlink, and the receiver must be wired to a full UART.  See "
"`ExpressLRS site <https://www.expresslrs.org/>`  and :ref:`TBS CRSF/ ELRS "
"<common-tbs-rc>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"备注 4：ELRS（ExpressLRS）是一款灵活的开源系统，可输出 CRSF、SBUS 或 MAVLink（含嵌入 RC）协议。数传功能需要使用 "
"CRSF 或 MAVLink，且接收机必须连接至完整的 UART 接口。更多信息请参阅 `ExpressLRS 官网 "
"<https://www.expresslrs.org/>`__ 和 :ref:`TBS CRSF / ELRS <common-tbs-rc>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:179
#: 3673ef8fc4d84134b2fa7c69d62c4a5a 4bbcd7dd942f4f4eb731970bbe1fd7d9
#: 57ec715a36e34b61ba7b4756dc640f40 d79eb453642e431295927b35449868d6
#: f028c8039f1f47658dd4609e86187b38 f4bd5881ba5a490dbeba5d8f3f15d497
msgid ""
"Note 5: The mLRS project is firmware designed specifically to carry both RC "
"and MAVLink. The usable telemetry speed varies by the chosen mode and is "
"managed via RADIO_STATUS flow control. It uses the CRSF (TBS Crossfire) RC "
"protocol on both the receiver and Tx module.  It also integrates full "
"MAVLink telemetry via serial connections on the Tx module and the receiver."
msgstr ""
"备注 5：mLRS 项目是专为同时承载 RC 和 MAVLink 而设计的固件。可用数传速率因所选模式而异，通过 RADIO_STATUS "
"流控制进行管理。其在接收机和发射模块上均使用 CRSF（TBS Crossfire）RC 协议，并通过发射模块和接收机上的串口连接集成完整的 "
"MAVLink 数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:181
#: fd393978d4d34257aed72f266b82d8bc
msgid ""
"Note 6: Vendor Specific Telem means that they accomodate sensor additions to"
" the vehicle and can display the information on certain Vendor specific TXs "
"but do not send ArduPilot telemetry from the vehicle to ArduPilot compatible"
" GCS or OpenTX display scripts."
msgstr ""
"备注 6：「厂商特定数传」意味着它们支持在飞行器上添加传感器并可在特定厂商的发射机上显示信息，但不能将 ArduPilot 数传从飞行器发送至 "
"ArduPilot 兼容地面站或 OpenTX 显示脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:183
#: 027979a4cf924ad58bef46105df7150f 22fdeab66398495ebfc293c552cce5de
#: 93c8d563b2ad46f68b7f05120f98123e ae66f7891150409ea16c2ea37b6dea82
#: dd45a0ef016f44b085c8a29f86f6e9eb ee9faae540364db3846270f546af15b9
msgid ""
"Note 7: The receiver must support i-BUS telemetry (look for a SENS port on "
"the receiver or check the product specifications)."
msgstr "备注 7：接收机必须支持 i-BUS 数传（查看接收机上是否有 SENS 接口，或查阅产品规格）。"

