msgstr "PPM 编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:238
#: 1ffec6a4147f4889bc0d5ffb39e015eb 4572a07c7e0146308dcb3c1c5dc958d4
#: 4d67362868d4443bb17b1d7426f6755a 6b054ee07a164115a2379f31949f7ebf
#: 7eb027d221684380b04517c97de2c20b 8b26f0c2b97e4095af4e2356f40a110d
msgid ""
"A `PPM Encoder <https://www.amazon.com/s?k=ppm+encoder>`__ will allow you to"
" use any older style RC receiver that has only PWM outputs for each channel "
"instead of an SBUS or PPM output. See :ref:`common-ppm-encoders-new` for "
"more information. This protocol is not being included on many new autopilots"
" and is being slowly obsoleted."
msgstr ""
"`PPM 编码器 <https://www.amazon.com/s?k=ppm+encoder>`__ 可让您使用每个通道只有 PWM 输出（而非 "
"SBUS 或 PPM 输出）的旧款 RC 接收机。详情参见 :ref:`common-ppm-encoders-"
"new`。该协议已不再出现在许多新飞控上，正在逐渐被淘汰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:177
#: 44294180de1542948f85d80b82a6a3e1 542467b983c54f55971230f57a401bfa
#: 83fe6d1a80c347459f6d292c540d553b c0b27d6a0de0484981764391bc6d27bd
#: c191aee8318f45f3b2ad138e9ccf3b6c
msgid ""
"Note 4: ELRS (ExpressLRS) is a flexible open-source system that can output "
"CRSF, SBUS, or MAVLink (with embedded RC) protocols. Telemetry requires the "
"use of CRSF or Mavlink, and the receiver must be wired to a full UART.  See "
"`ExpressLRS site <https://www.expresslrs.org/>__`  and :ref:`TBS CRSF/ ELRS "
"<common-tbs-rc>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"注 4：ELRS（ExpressLRS）是一个灵活的开源系统，可输出 CRSF、SBUS 或 MAVLink（内嵌 RC）协议。数传需要使用 CRSF "
"或 Mavlink，且接收机必须接到完整的 UART。更多信息参见 `ExpressLRS site "
"<https://www.expresslrs.org/>__` 和 :ref:`TBS CRSF/ ELRS <common-tbs-rc>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:181
#: 40d0054af4f94b9f81a4c9eee0419435 664237af034c42df8490b58ad1615167
#: 6aca3f40e2104e568b132de0a0782e35 be4ef06de6ff4f70bc1ea92b4577e77f
#: eba2f705a5e04ef58c3ed0dfea034257
msgid ""
"Note 6: Vendor Specific Telem means that they accommodate sensor additions "
"to the vehicle and can display the information on certain Vendor specific "
"TXs but do not send ArduPilot telemetry from the vehicle to ArduPilot "
"compatible GCS or OpenTX display scripts."
msgstr ""
"注 6：厂商专有遥测（Vendor Specific Telem）是指其支持在载具上添加传感器，并能在特定厂商的遥控器上显示这些信息，但不会把载具的 "
"ArduPilot 数传发送到 ArduPilot 兼容的地面站或 OpenTX 显示脚本。"
